WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.452
Two ablations stand out.

00:00:01.532 --> 00:00:06.880
Representing each element by a bounding box with
two keypoints beats the alternatives

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.753
by two Fréchet and over seven Chamfer points.

00:00:09.833 --> 00:00:14.606
Two-stage training, teacher forcing then
fine-tuning on predicted keypoints,

00:00:14.686 --> 00:00:17.990
adds about seven mAP for camera and eight for fusion.
